  "content": "<h4><span style=\"color:#800080\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/839151/description_f7f99097-a555-474c-af6a-cccec4d8a1e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"> <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fvayns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">您可以在這裡支持我！ ：）</a></span></strong></em></span></h4><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1114139/description_8fc738d9-8710-4ab8-8727-4e28ebb081b6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Feur 叢林擴展</strong></span> 是一款帶領玩家深入 Minecraft 叢林核心的模組，這裡未馴化的自然與古老秘密交織。發現新型雄偉樹木，為茂密植被帶來多樣性；探索隱藏在濃密綠意中的獨特金字塔，充滿陷阱與被遺忘的寶藏。但還不止如此：古老村莊，廢棄且荒涼，藏著失落文明的秘密，等待探索！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1114139/description_0f3fcb36-7177-4843-94b9-192da4227285.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"529\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Feur 叢林擴展</em></strong> 添加了額外內容，因此與其他模組的結構生成不會衝突。<br>您也可以在這裡享受 FEUR 系列：<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/feur-extension-fossil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1114139/description_a659184d-0a76-4a7c-a98b-ce53fc1f0fc3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"147\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/feur-extension-desert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1117070/description_5ce70afb-8af6-4a8c-ab92-bed813f8d73b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"147\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/feur-dungeon-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1117070/description_02565e29-0832-473e-92ea-e6c26849f87f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"147\"></a></p>",
